  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44115610",
      "title": "Scoping CSS Styles to Components",
      "lectureOrder": 111,
      "videoOrder": 105,
      "sourceHash": "323527c23386a7357d0f6781dc0c80785f73b7e57016d2190e36093cb822bf0e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.63,
          "end": 4.29,
          "en": "So now at this point we added a bunch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.29,
          "end": 5.94,
          "en": "of new Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.94,
          "end": 8.64,
          "en": "and all these Components have their CSS files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.64,
          "end": 11.5,
          "en": "but all those files are empty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.5,
          "end": 14.7,
          "en": "because at the moment all these styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.7,
          "end": 18.963,
          "en": "are in that style.CSS file for simplicity reasons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.01,
          "end": 25.01,
          "en": "But this styles.CSS file has one potential disadvantage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.14,
          "end": 28.29,
          "en": "All the styles defined in there are global,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.29,
          "end": 32.52,
          "en": "which means they affect all components the entire website,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.52,
          "end": 35.94,
          "en": "which sometimes of course can also be an advantage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.94,
          "end": 40.38,
          "en": "But often you wanna scope your styles to your components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.38,
          "end": 43.473,
          "en": "to avoid accidental style clashes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45.09,
          "end": 48.42,
          "en": "And therefore what we might want to do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 48.42,
          "end": 49.74,
          "en": "and what you typically want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.74,
          "end": 52.38,
          "en": "to do in your Angular projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.38,
          "end": 55.89,
          "en": "is that you wanna put the styles that belong",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.89,
          "end": 60.12,
          "en": "to a component into the style file of that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.12,
          "end": 62.73,
          "en": "Because any CSS styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.73,
          "end": 67.11,
          "en": "that go into such a component specific style file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.11,
          "end": 72.11,
          "en": "by default will be scoped to that component by Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 72.69,
          "end": 76.05,
          "en": "So they will be restricted to that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 76.05,
          "end": 79.263,
          "en": "and can't accidentally affect other components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 79.263,
          "end": 83.913,
          "en": "or any other markup anywhere else on the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 85.35,
          "end": 89.1,
          "en": "So for example, we can grab this header rule here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 89.1,
          "end": 91.59,
          "en": "this header selector, this rule,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 91.59,
          "end": 94.44,
          "en": "and also all the other header related rules,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 94.44,
          "end": 96.72,
          "en": "which are all these rules",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 96.72,
          "end": 99.60300000000001,
          "en": "up to including this media query.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 101.07,
          "end": 103.8,
          "en": "And cut it from the styles.CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 103.8,
          "end": 107.043,
          "en": "and add it to the header.component CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 109.08,
          "end": 110.52000000000001,
          "en": "Now you must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 110.52000000000001,
          "end": 114.9,
          "en": "that this header component CSS file then is referenced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 114.9,
          "end": 117.47999999999999,
          "en": "by the header component TypeScript file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 117.47999999999999,
          "end": 121.05,
          "en": "and the class there, which is the case here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 121.05,
          "end": 123.33,
          "en": "Otherwise it would be ignored.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 123.33,
          "end": 125.28,
          "en": "But with that, if you save that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 125.28,
          "end": 128.61,
          "en": "with those styles removed from the styles.CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.61,
          "end": 132.183,
          "en": "and added here to the header component CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 133.59,
          "end": 135.39,
          "en": "you'll see that the application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 135.39,
          "end": 137.7,
          "en": "looks just the way it did before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 137.7,
          "end": 141.18,
          "en": "But now we have this better structure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 141.18,
          "end": 143.16,
          "en": "this better approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 143.16,
          "end": 147.34,
          "en": "where we have the styles in the component style file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 148.26,
          "end": 152.4,
          "en": "and we now might wanna migrate all those styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 152.4,
          "end": 154.59,
          "en": "to their respective components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 154.59,
          "end": 157.77,
          "en": "But since this is some annoying work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.77,
          "end": 160.82999999999998,
          "en": "I did it for you and attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 160.82999999999998,
          "end": 164.25,
          "en": "you therefore find new style files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 164.25,
          "end": 166.96699999999998,
          "en": "for the control.component CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 166.96699999999998,
          "end": 170.493,
          "en": "and for those other Components as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 171.42000000000002,
          "end": 174.6,
          "en": "So you should use these attached CSS files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 174.6,
          "end": 179.4,
          "en": "and replace your component CSS files with them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 179.4,
          "end": 180.45,
          "en": "And in addition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 180.45,
          "end": 184.77,
          "en": "you also find an updated styles.CSS file attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 184.77,
          "end": 188.85,
          "en": "and then replace your styles.CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 188.85,
          "end": 190.623,
          "en": "with the attached one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 191.61,
          "end": 194.91,
          "en": "For those styles to work, you should also make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 194.91,
          "end": 198.39,
          "en": "that in the server status component HTML file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 198.39,
          "end": 202.203,
          "en": "you also add an idea of status to that diff.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 203.82,
          "end": 207.03,
          "en": "And once you then completed this migration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 207.03,
          "end": 211.38,
          "en": "and you revisit your page, you'll notice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 211.38,
          "end": 214.17000000000002,
          "en": "that some things look broken here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 214.17000000000002,
          "end": 218.65,
          "en": "Most importantly the button, but also those inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 219.9,
          "end": 221.61,
          "en": "and that's not a mistake.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 221.61,
          "end": 225.15,
          "en": "Instead, I did indeed change some styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 225.15,
          "end": 228.06,
          "en": "so that they at the moment won't work anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 228.06,
          "end": 230.37,
          "en": "because we'll soon adjust the application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 230.37,
          "end": 232.53,
          "en": "to make them work again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 232.53,
          "end": 236.43,
          "en": "But for example, here in the control component CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 236.43,
          "end": 238.77,
          "en": "I actually added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 238.77,
          "end": 243.77,
          "en": "this control class selector here in my CSS rules.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 243.81,
          "end": 246,
          "en": "And I'm then looking for labels and inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 246,
          "end": 250.02,
          "en": "and text areas inside of elements with the control class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 250.02,
          "end": 253.083,
          "en": "And at the moment, this class isn't used anywhere.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 254.13,
          "end": 257.58,
          "en": "And similarly in the button component CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 257.58,
          "end": 259.33299999999997,
          "en": "I'm looking for a button element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 259.33299999999997,
          "end": 263.91,
          "en": "but there is no button element in here in this template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 263.91,
          "end": 266.16,
          "en": "There are only are spans in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 266.16,
          "end": 268.44,
          "en": "So these styles also break",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 268.44,
          "end": 272.55,
          "en": "because now these styles are scoped to their components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 272.55,
          "end": 276.12,
          "en": "And if I have some buttons somewhere else in my application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 276.12,
          "end": 279.39,
          "en": "that rule here won't change it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 279.39,
          "end": 282.151,
          "en": "because like all the other CSS code in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 282.151,
          "end": 286.89,
          "en": "it is scoped to this component and this template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 286.89,
          "end": 291.36,
          "en": "And here in this template we have no button element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 291.36,
          "end": 294.025,
          "en": "So that's why some styles are failing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 294.025,
          "end": 296.52,
          "en": "but we'll now take care of that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 296.52,
          "end": 300.54,
          "en": "and along the way, dive into some new Angular concepts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 300.54,
          "end": 301.443,
          "en": "and features.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
